==English==
{{wikipedia|dab=Koro (disambiguation)}}

===Etymology===
Possibly from {{bor|en|mak|{{l|mak|garring}} {{l|mak|koro'}}}} (lit. ''koro'' illness, "shrinking of the toilet", Matthes 1859), {{bor|en|bug|-}}, or {{bor|en|ms|-}}. See "[[w:Koro (medicine)#Etymology and geographical background|Koro § Etymology and geographical background]]" at Wikipedia for a full discussion.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{lb|en|psychology}} A [[delusion]]al syndrome found in [[Malay]] and southern [[Chinese]] populations, characterized by a belief that the subject's [[penis]] will retract into the abdomen and cause death.

===References===
* Mathes B. F. (1859). ''Makassaarsch-Hollandsch Woordenboek.'' Amsterdam: Het Nederlandsch Bijbelgenootschap te Amsterdam, p. 43 ("''inkrimping van het gemak''").

